name: "eclipsed"
description:
'''Basic HJSON mod designed to be a weird middle child between Serpulo and Erekir.

A dull, lonely planet covered in shores, valleys and mountains orbiting a sad red dwarf star; Drevosk.

The inhabitants here don't seem to appreciate your attempt to colonize the planet.''' 
